# Baseline B-09 (negotiation-9): a proposal set covering both spoken
# versions, 5.4 first in client order (00 00 04 05, then 00 00 04 04 and
# Bolt 3), is answered with the first proposal the server supports in
# client order (ADR-0484 decision 2): 00 00 04 05, and the connection
# then serves a session at 5.4: a 5.x HELLO — user_agent plus the
# mandatory bolt_agent map (ADR-0484 decision 3) — succeeds. The leading
# C: <RAW> is the script's own handshake, so there is no automatic one
# and no !: AUTO HELLO.
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: <RAW> 60 60 B0 17 00 00 04 05 00 00 04 04 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 00
S: <RAW> 00 00 04 05
C: HELLO {"user_agent": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0", "bolt_agent": {"product": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0"}}
S: SUCCESS {}
